# HACA test conventions

- No real network: `httpx.MockTransport` or `haca.simulation` only.
- Markers: `security`, `simulation`, `live` (live skipped by default).
- Synthetic identifiers only: `SYNTH-` serials, `00:00:5E:00:53:xx` MACs, `192.168.250.0/24`, UUID `00000000-0000-0000-0000-0000000000xx`.
- Every acceptance criterion of the task maps to at least one named test.
- Canary secrets (e.g. `CANARY-PW-7f3a`) must never appear in logs or outputs.
